# Allowlist: nothing goes into the build context except what the image needs. A new file
# (a .env, a model, a dataset, test data...) stays out unless it is added here on purpose.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/

# Never, even inside an allowed folder or if the allowlist above grows by mistake.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/models
**/evals
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
